'''The Mother Board''' is a Tower Shield purchasable with {{Item|Party Favor}}s, earned during the [[Anniversary Party|DDO Anniversary Party]] <!-- , introduced with [[13th Anniversary]]-->. Six versions are available, for ML 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30.
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 5)}}
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 10)}}
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 15)}}
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 20)}}
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 25)}}
* {{Item|The Mother Board (level 30)}}

This item was introduced with the [[12th Anniversary]] (February 2018).

